WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,700
fifteen days

2
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,700
Turn this place into a fortress that no one can break down

3
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:21,640
It was detected that the epidemic prevention effect of barbed wire reinforcement has increased by a hundred times

4
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,640
This is upgraded

5
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:25,670
This network source can stop people first

6
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:27,670
Can't stop the car from hitting me hard

7
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:29,670
Not to mention that funerals are packed in.

8
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,900
Now thousands of them are crashing into each other.

9
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,150
I can't even tear it open.

10
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:37,750
Got it, you're hungry too

11
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:39,750
It’s time to eat after a long night’s work

12
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:44,470
The buns I packed in yesterday

13
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:46,470
Why is it still hot?

14
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:52,730
Not plugged in and still catching ice

15
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:54,890
Things in this space

16
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:56,890
It's not bad, it can't be painted

17
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:59,110
That'll be easy

18
00:00:59,110 --> 00:01:01,110
When a grain factory opens a village, it doesn’t take much of it.
